<title>JAPAN: Fujisawa Pharm - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujisawa Pharm - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		111.27		vs	  106.37</p>
<p> Operating	    9.10		vs	    9.16</p>
<p> Current	     12.06		vs	   10.79</p>
<p> Net		    3.90		vs	    2.95</p>
<p> EPS		   12.15 yen	  vs	    9.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    321 million	  vs	 321 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujisawa Pharmaceutical Co Ltd is a pharmaceutical maker with emphasis on antibiotics.</p>
</text>
